* ft_boost_models.lib — behavioral/device models for the fault-tolerant
* two-phase interleaved boost converter (KiCad / ngspice).
*
* All values are generic or datasheet-typical; replace with vendor models
* (and your measured G2RL data) when available. See DESIGN_NOTES.md.

*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Omron G2RL-1A (12 VDC coil) — contact as voltage-controlled switch.
* Coil 360 ohm (33.3 mA @ 12 V). Must-operate 70 % (8.4 V), must-release
* 10 % (1.2 V) -> vt=4.8, vh=3.6. Operate/release TIMING IS IDEALIZED here;
* the controller applies an optional release delay (sim/controller.py).
* Port order = KiCad symbol pin order: 13 (COM), 14 (NO), A1, A2 (coil).
*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt G2RL1A COM NO A1 A2
Rcoil A1 A2 360
S1 COM NO A1 A2 SWG2RL
.model SWG2RL sw vt=4.8 vh=3.6 ron=0.05 roff=100Meg
.ends G2RL1A

*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* 4-terminal Kelvin shunt, 10 mohm. Ports: F1 S1 S2 F2 (force, sense, sense, force)
*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt RSHUNT10M F1 S1 S2 F2
R1 F1 F2 10m
RS1 F1 S1 1m
RS2 F2 S2 1m
.ends RSHUNT10M

*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* TI AMC1300 reinforced-isolated amplifier (behavioral).
* +/-250 mV linear input, fixed gain 8.2 (differential out), ~300 kHz
* bandwidth, ~2 us signal delay, 1.44 V output common mode.
* Pins: VDD1 VINP VINN GND1 GND2 VOUTN VOUTP VDD2
*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt AMC1300 VDD1 VINP VINN GND1 GND2 VOUTN VOUTP VDD2
Rq1 VDD1 GND1 1k
Rq2 VDD2 GND2 1k
Bin n1 0 V = max(-0.25, min(0.25, V(VINP,VINN)))
R1 n1 n2 1k
C1 n2 0 530p
Ebuf n2b 0 n2 0 1
T1 n2b 0 n3 0 td=2u z0=1k
Rt n3 0 1k
Bp VOUTP GND2 V = 1.44 + 4.1*V(n3)
Bn VOUTN GND2 V = 1.44 - 4.1*V(n3)
.ends AMC1300

*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* 650 V N-channel power MOSFET (generic superjunction-class VDMOS),
* Rds(on) ~ 80 mohm, body-diode avalanche at 650 V.
* Ports: D G S
*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt NMOS650V D G S
M1 D G S VDM650
.model VDM650 VDMOS(Rg=1.5 Vto=3.8 Rd=50m Rs=8m Rb=30m Kp=25 Lambda=0.01
+ Cgdmax=1n Cgdmin=20p A=0.5 Cgs=2n Cjo=400p Is=1e-11 N=1.1 Tt=50n
+ bv=650 ibv=250u)
.ends NMOS650V

*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* 650 V SiC Schottky boost diode (generic). Ports: K A
*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt SICSBD650 K A
D1 A K DSIC
.model DSIC D(Is=5.9e-14 N=1.3 Rs=0.08 Cjo=250p M=0.5 Vj=1 bv=650 ibv=100u Tt=0)
.ends SICSBD650

*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Freewheel diode (UF4007-class) and 100 V TVS (SMBJ100A-class, BV ~111 V)
* used to clamp the inductive kick when a phase relay opens under current.
*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt DFAST K A
D1 A K DUF
.model DUF D(Is=1e-9 N=1.7 Rs=0.04 Cjo=20p Tt=50n bv=1000 ibv=10u)
.ends DFAST

.subckt TVS100 K A
D1 A K DTVS
.model DTVS D(Is=1e-12 N=1 Rs=0.5 Cjo=500p bv=111 ibv=1m)
.ends TVS100

*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* PWM comparator + gate driver: G-GND = 12 V while V(DUTY) > V(CARR).
* Driving DUTY below 0 inhibits the gate (fault isolation).
* Ports: G GND DUTY CARR
*---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt PWM_GDRV G GND DUTY CARR
B1 gi GND V = 6 + 6*tanh(5000*(V(DUTY)-V(CARR)))
Rg gi G 4.7
.ends PWM_GDRV
